{%- if page.handle == 'contact' or page.handle == 'contact-us' or page.title == 'Contact' or page.title == 'Contact Us' -%}
  {% section 'contact-form' %}
{%- else -%}
  <section class="main-page section-padding">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="main-page__inner">

        <header class="main-page__header text-center animate-on-scroll">
          <h1 class="main-page__title">{{ page.title | escape }}</h1>
          <div class="main-page__divider"></div>
        </header>

        {%- if page.content != blank -%}
          <div class="main-page__content rte animate-on-scroll delay-1">
            {{ page.content }}
          </div>
        {%- elsif page.handle contains 'safety' or page.title contains 'Safety' -%}
          <div class="main-page__content rte animate-on-scroll delay-1">
            
            <div class="safety-banner-box">
              <h2>Our Commitment to Safety</h2>
              <p>At Little Creation, your little one's safety and well-being is always at the heart of what we do. We use exclusively <strong>100% Premium Food-Grade Platinum Silicone</strong> across our entire teether collection — completely free from BPA, BPS, PVC, phthalates, lead, latex, and heavy metals.</p>
              <p>Every product undergoes strict, independent lab testing to meet and exceed <strong>UK (UKCA)</strong> and <strong>EU (EN71-1, 2, 3)</strong> safety standards. Whether it is playtime or teething time, you can trust that every Little Creation piece is made to be 100% safe, gentle, and worry-free for your baby.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Image Placeholder 1 -->
            <div class="safety-img-placeholder">
              <span class="safety-img-placeholder__icon">📷</span>
              <strong>[ Image Placeholder: Upload Premium Silicone Teether Photo ]</strong>
              <span>Recommended size: 800 x 450 px</span>
            </div>

            <h3>Why Parents & Specialists Love Silicone</h3>
            <p>Food-grade platinum silicone is soft, resilient, and baby-tough. Formulated from natural silica elements, it provides the ideal balance of gentle flexibility to comfort tender gums without sacrificing durability. From cooling teethers to rattles, silicone is non-porous, naturally hygienic, and effortless to clean.</p>

            <h3>Why We're All About Platinum Silicone</h3>
            <div class="safety-table-wrap">
              <table class="safety-table">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>#</th>
                    <th>Key Feature</th>
                    <th>Description</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>1</strong></td>
                    <td><strong>Flexible & Durable</strong></td>
                    <td>Built for daily baby life. Resists cracks, scuffs, and fading — even after endless washes, intense teething bites, and floor drops.</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>2</strong></td>
                    <td><strong>Heat & Cold Resistant</strong></td>
                    <td>From refrigerator cooling to boiling water sanitization — withstands extreme temperatures without warping, melting, or degrading.</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>3</strong></td>
                    <td><strong>Bacteria & Odor Resistant</strong></td>
                    <td>Non-porous molecular structure means zero micro-cracks for moisture or germs to hide. Naturally repels odors and stays fresh.</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><strong>4</strong></td>
                    <td><strong>UKCA & EN71 Certified</strong></td>
                    <td>Independently tested by accredited safety labs to exceed UK (UKCA) and European (EN71) child toy safety requirements.</td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>

            <!-- Image Placeholder 2 -->
            <div class="safety-img-placeholder">
              <span class="safety-img-placeholder__icon">🔬</span>
              <strong>[ Image Placeholder: Upload Safety Lab Testing / Certificate Badge ]</strong>
              <span>Recommended size: 800 x 400 px</span>
            </div>

            <h3>Understanding Platinum Silicone Purity</h3>
            <p>Not all silicone is created equal. Little Creation uses <strong>100% Platinum-Cured Food-Grade Silicone</strong> — the highest standard of silicone purity. Unlike lower-grade silicones cured with peroxide, platinum curing leaves zero chemical fillers or residues behind.</p>
            <p>Every single production batch is independently inspected and tested so you can give our products to your baby with absolute peace of mind.</p>

            <!-- FAQ Section -->
            <div class="safety-faq-card">
              <h4>FAQ: Why does new silicone sometimes have a slight packaging scent?</h4>
              <p>You might notice a subtle "fresh" scent when unboxing your new Little Creation products. This is completely normal, harmless, and safe.</p>
              <p><strong>The Science:</strong> Our 100% Platinum Silicone is cured at high temperatures during manufacturing. Because items are hygienically sealed immediately after cooling to protect them during transit, natural warm air can remain trapped inside the airtight package.</p>
              <p>This is <em>not</em> toxic chemical off-gassing. It is simply trapped air from the thermal stabilization process.</p>

              <div class="safety-boil-guide">
                <h5>How to refresh it instantly:</h5>
                <ul>
                  <li><strong>♨️ The 5-Minute Boil Test:</strong> Place the silicone product in a pot of boiling water for 5 minutes.</li>
                  <li><strong>🌬️ Air Dry:</strong> Allow it to air dry completely in a clean, ventilated area.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>The gentle heat allows any residual trapped moisture to evaporate, leaving pure, completely odorless silicone.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Declaration of Conformity Section at Bottom -->
            <div id="declaration-of-conformity" class="pdf-section" style="margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1.5px solid var(--color-border, #E8D5C4);">
              <h3>Declaration of Conformity</h3>
              <p>Below are the official Declaration of Conformity documents for Little Creation products, certifying full compliance with UKCA and EU Toy Safety Regulations (EN71 standards).</p>
              
              <div class="pdf-grid">
                <div class="pdf-card">
                  <div class="pdf-card__icon">📄</div>
                  <div class="pdf-card__info">
                    <strong>Lion Rattle Teether Safety Declaration</strong>
                    <span>EN71-1, 2, 3 & UKCA Certified</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="pdf-card__btn">Download PDF 📄</span>
                </div>
                <div class="pdf-card">
                  <div class="pdf-card__icon">📄</div>
                  <div class="pdf-card__info">
                    <strong>Cooling Teether Safety Declaration</strong>
                    <span>EN71-1, 2, 3 & UKCA Certified</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="pdf-card__btn">Download PDF 📄</span>
                </div>
                <div class="pdf-card">
                  <div class="pdf-card__icon">📄</div>
                  <div class="pdf-card__info">
                    <strong>Swan Wooden Ring Teether Declaration</strong>
                    <span>EN71-1, 2, 3 & UKCA Certified</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="pdf-card__btn">Download PDF 📄</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        {%- elsif page.handle contains 'declaration' or page.title contains 'Declaration' -%}
          <div class="main-page__content rte animate-on-scroll delay-1">
            <h2>Declaration of Conformity</h2>
            <p>This page contains the official Declaration of Conformity documents for Little Creation products, certifying full compliance with UKCA and EU Toy Safety Regulations (EN71 standards).</p>
            
            <div class="pdf-section">
              <h3>Official Product Certificates & Declarations</h3>
              <p>Click below to download or view the official safety declarations for each product:</p>
              
              <div class="pdf-grid">
                <div class="pdf-card">
                  <div class="pdf-card__icon">📄</div>
                  <div class="pdf-card__info">
                    <strong>Lion Rattle Teether Safety Declaration</strong>
                    <span>EN71-1, 2, 3 & UKCA Certified</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="pdf-card__btn">[ PDF File Placeholder ]</span>
                </div>
                <div class="pdf-card">
                  <div class="pdf-card__icon">📄</div>
                  <div class="pdf-card__info">
                    <strong>Cooling Teether Safety Declaration</strong>
                    <span>EN71-1, 2, 3 & UKCA Certified</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="pdf-card__btn">[ PDF File Placeholder ]</span>
                </div>
                <div class="pdf-card">
                  <div class="pdf-card__icon">📄</div>
                  <div class="pdf-card__info">
                    <strong>Swan Wooden Ring Teether Declaration</strong>
                    <span>EN71-1, 2, 3 & UKCA Certified</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="pdf-card__btn">[ PDF File Placeholder ]</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="main-page__empty text-center animate-on-scroll delay-1">
            <p class="main-page__empty-text">This page content is currently empty. You can add content to this page in <strong>Shopify Admin → Pages → Edit {{ page.title | escape }}</strong>.</p>
            <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="button">Explore Products</a>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
  .main-page {
    padding-top: var(--spacing-xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--spacing-xxl);
  }
  .main-page__inner {
    max-width: 840px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .main-page__header {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }
  .main-page__title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
    color: var(--color-heading);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .main-page__divider {
    width: 60px;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--color-primary), var(--color-secondary));
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    margin: var(--spacing-sm) auto 0;
  }

  .main-page__content {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background: var(--color-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
    .main-page__content {
      padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-md);
    }
  }
  .main-page__content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25em;
  }
  .main-page__content p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .main-page__content h2, .main-page__content h3, .main-page__content h4 {
    color: var(--color-heading);
    margin-top: 1.5em;
    margin-bottom: 0.6em;
  }
  .main-page__content ul, .main-page__content ol {
    padding-left: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25em;
  }
  .main-page__content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5em;
  }

  /* ---- Safety Page Enhancements ---- */
  .safety-banner-box {
    background: var(--color-skin-pale, #FBF0E8);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border, #E8D5C4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 20px);
    padding: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .safety-banner-box h2 {
    margin-top: 0 !important;
  }

  .safety-img-placeholder {
    background: #F5F5F5;
    border: 2px dashed #CBD5E1;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 20px);
    padding: 36px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 24px 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    color: #64748B;
  }
  .safety-img-placeholder__icon {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
  }
  .safety-img-placeholder strong {
    color: #334155;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .safety-img-placeholder span {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .safety-table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 20px 0 28px 0;
  }
  .safety-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #E8D5C4);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .safety-table th, .safety-table td {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #E8D5C4);
    text-align: left;
  }
  .safety-table th {
    background: var(--color-skin-pale, #FBF0E8);
    color: var(--color-heading, #111111);
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .safety-table tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .safety-faq-card {
    background: #FFFDF9;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border, #E8D5C4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 20px);
    padding: 24px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }
  .safety-faq-card h4 {
    margin-top: 0 !important;
    color: var(--color-heading, #111111);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .safety-boil-guide {
    background: #EFF6FF;
    border: 1px solid #BFDBFE;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .safety-boil-guide h5 {
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #1E40AF;
  }

  /* ---- PDF Declaration Grid ---- */
  .pdf-section {
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .pdf-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .pdf-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    background: var(--color-skin-pale, #FBF0E8);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border, #E8D5C4);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
  }
  .pdf-card__icon {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
  }
  .pdf-card__info {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .pdf-card__info strong {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-heading, #111111);
  }
  .pdf-card__info span {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark, #A07855);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .pdf-card__btn {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #64748B;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border: 1px dashed #CBD5E1;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }

  /* Automatic PDF Link styling inside pages */
  .main-page__content a[href*=".pdf"] {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--color-primary, #C69A7C);
    color: var(--color-white, #FFFFFF) !important;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill, 999px);
    text-decoration: none !important;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
    margin: 4px 0;
  }
  .main-page__content a[href*=".pdf"]:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-dark, #A07855);
  }

  .main-page__empty {
    background: var(--color-skin-pale);
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
  }
  .main-page__empty-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 0.8;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Page content",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
